<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sri Lankan Air Force hosted a Myanmar military delegation for talks, while Myanmar’s shadow banking network is moving billions abroad, bypassing military-controlled banks. Young men in Myanmar live in fear of being snatched off the streets and forced into service by the army. The United States opened direct talks with Myanmar’s generals and lifted sanctions on the daughter of a military-linked businessman, and Min Aung Hlaing met Malaysian officials. Health-care facilities continued to be attacked, as documented for 16‑30 September 2026. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNQTVpZE5UV1AyRTlYMkZQSEdEVjRDR3RmQzQ4YjdESm1EQkZDSjJYVGxRZ0VPNXAtQkxQSXRSUndtTmoyTEZaWnBiYXU0NXdVbFZ2ZzItOFBFcDktX1dpM0Uta2VxUTB6WWZJN2I0V2xyMmZJQ1JvM01CY29IUUhoZFRYaC13N2h0bWF1MHVjWTNZWDZONWNvMjM1WDVLa2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPVmxzZS1MalRNRE5OOW9wVHVtMEROTWFHdHQ0SnZpOEJaRTNCVmVaZkxaTlI4RzdENTg5OWhEMUtNNjI5b18tQWNjQ2prcjc1YVdIQ3FTS01FUVRpWVV4OGJZR2lka1puem82a0t6NWlRYVBUM2F5czRwTmFYTXVLT2U1SFNvZUd0NlAxRGZPZEJPSDN0MWlmNmJrNGFGUFlQS0g4Y1J2aWJyUk1ORlJrdXJsWTVqby1lWXhWYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNU2RISnhtclBRX1kxTDE5RHNvWUJTRGxIUTRtaEpDMkRQWVIzeFdISVVZRGU4eDFzTUdSTFZfU0pjZzZiaURvZlBGVFRBSnZ5SVA0R2FqQnFpVDRpMFctQmZXMmNQZV91a2xRamVsNDJIT3NYRE5hQWdKV2Z0RXRrVkE0QV9jbG93ZE5jSHNyRkp4X2tLNlVhS2RoWFF0QWh4Q0QyUDd3djNZLU9fMHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE81cUwzVENRMVE0LTFSc1BCcXZ5UHZaZ09Ya18xYlhyY0w4TmNkQXlMSHdidE5PbzhuZUZ6VWs3eGNxckdTSzk5UzFwRUZIaUtVdHV1clN1REVXQ1hMOXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/